    ************************************************************
   *                                                          *
   *  You can interact with items in the room (they end with  *
   *  an asterisk *) by running them as a command script.     *
   *                                                          *
   *  For example, to collect a sparkling treasure:           *
   *     👉  ./treasure                                       *
   *                                                          *
   *  The . (dot) means *don't move*, and the name of the     *
   *  script makes the code run. This is a relative path!     *
   *  The . strictly means the current room (directory).      *
   *                                                          *
   *  You may have left shiny treasure in the previous room.  *
   *  Go back to a previous directory with two dots,          *
   *  which means *take a single step backward*.              *
   *                                                          *
   *  EXAMPLE INCANTATION:                                    *
   *     👉  cd ..                                            *
   *                                                          *
    ***********************************************************

